{"2508170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Homespace", "steam_appid": 2508170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><br>Lay the foundation, put up walls, add a ceiling. Any block shrinks or grows to the size you need, so the house comes out exactly the way you planned it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/9203aeffd9e1df4af4fdf6870833b698.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/9203aeffd9e1df4af4fdf6870833b698.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/9203aeffd9e1df4af4fdf6870833b698.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A copy of your future apartment, the house of your dreams, a memory from childhood. In Homespace you can build anything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/205e6bc0707a971b4e898103befcd879.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/205e6bc0707a971b4e898103befcd879.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/205e6bc0707a971b4e898103befcd879.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DECORATE</strong></h2><br>Turn empty rooms into a real home: lay the floor, paint the walls, arrange the furniture, hang the paintings. Pick from hundreds of options or add your own, and if you're not sure what goes with what, the game will suggest a match.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/d9e253bf212e931a21904f0b5421f240.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/d9e253bf212e931a21904f0b5421f240.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/d9e253bf212e931a21904f0b5421f240.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Change the time of day, the color of the sun, or apply a filter that turns the room into a movie scene.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/3879648cb85bd9f7c44106c6b8b7850f.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/3879648cb85bd9f7c44106c6b8b7850f.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/3879648cb85bd9f7c44106c6b8b7850f.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LIVE IN YOUR HOUSE</strong></h2><br>Go fishing or grow a garden, watch movies or listen to music, play a board game or host a musical evening with friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/274972057308774d9e328f8a1ac5d7dd.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/274972057308774d9e328f8a1ac5d7dd.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/274972057308774d9e328f8a1ac5d7dd.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Get a pet, add fish to the aquarium, put your own recipes in the kitchen and your own books in the library, set up a display case for the rare items and achievements you earned in other games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/44a5b917d0dbdcbf09d7d269d32932de.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/44a5b917d0dbdcbf09d7d269d32932de.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/44a5b917d0dbdcbf09d7d269d32932de.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Invite someone you just met to a round of your favorite game, open your house to everyone or make it completely private.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1256f39a4fa543cf240bc1c950d954b6.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1256f39a4fa543cf240bc1c950d954b6.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1256f39a4fa543cf240bc1c950d954b6.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNLOCK NEW STYLES</strong></h2><br>Build whatever you want in creative mode or take on quests: each one unlocks new styles, games to play, item sets and decor pieces. And in the Steam Workshop you'll find other players' creations. Add yours too!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1028c213b50f15c049e894fdec2f6939.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1028c213b50f15c049e894fdec2f6939.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/1028c213b50f15c049e894fdec2f6939.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD TOGETHER</strong></h2><br>Building doesn't end with one house. Streets appear beyond the house, town squares beyond the streets. Cities stretch all the way to the horizon. Team up with other players, start communities and build large-scale projects together: places from movies and your favorite games, and whole virtual cities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/4462ee0c6e685bd0315bd77b823bc6f7.poster.avif?t=1786105945\" width=780 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/4462ee0c6e685bd0315bd77b823bc6f7.webm?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2508170/extras/4462ee0c6e685bd0315bd77b823bc6f7.mp4?t=1786105945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD</strong></h2><br>Lay the foundation, put up walls, add a ceiling. Any block shrinks or grows to the size you need, so the house comes out exactly the way you planned it.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi